===== client errors (agent transcript) =====
=== run ===
Usage: hops job run [OPTIONS] NAME

  Start a new one-off execution of ``name``.

  ``--start-time`` / ``--end-time`` are passed straight through to the SDK and
  surface inside the job as ``HOPS_START_TIME`` / ``HOPS_END_TIME``. Useful
  when you want to nudge a single run to consume a specific data window
  without creating a schedule.

  Args:     ctx: Click context.     name: Job name.     app_args: Argument
  string passed to this execution.     wait: Block until the execution
  terminates.     start_time: ISO timestamp for ``HOPS_START_TIME``.
  end_time: ISO timestamp for ``HOPS_END_TIME``.

Options:
  --args TEXT                     Argument string passed to this execution.
  --wait                          Block until the execution terminates.
  --start-time [%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S|%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S%z|%Y-%m-%d]
                                  ISO timestamp for HOPS_START_TIME (data
                                  interval start).
  --end-time [%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S|%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S%z|%Y-%m-%d]
                                  ISO timestamp for HOPS_END_TIME (data
                                  interval end). Requires --start-time.
  --json / --no-json              Force JSON / force human tables (default:
                                  JSON when piped).
  --verify / --no-verify          Verify the Hopsworks TLS certificate; --no-
                                  verify skips verification for self-signed /
                                  IP-SAN-mismatched certs.
  -h, --help                      Show this message and exit.
=== files ===
Usage: hops files [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...

  File-system commands on HopsFS (list, mkdir, upload, download, share,
  remove).

Options:
  --json / --no-json      Force JSON / force human tables (default: JSON when
                          piped).
  --verify / --no-verify  Verify the Hopsworks TLS certificate; --no-verify
                          skips verification for self-signed / IP-SAN-
                          mismatched certs.
  -h, --help              Show this message and exit.

Commands:
  download  Download a file from HopsFS to the local filesystem.
  list      List files under ``path`` in the project's HopsFS.
  mkdir     Create a directory in the project's HopsFS.
  remove    Remove a file or directory from HopsFS.
  share     Share a dataset with another project.
  unshare   Revoke a previously-granted dataset share with another project.
  upload    Upload a local file to HopsFS.
